			<h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-8 text-center text-ink" style="width:100%; max-width:800px;">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
			<div class="space-y-4" style="width:100%;">
				<details class="group p-6 rounded-2xl bg-canvas border border-hairline card-shadow cursor-pointer">
					<summary class="flex items-center justify-between font-semibold text-ink list-none">
						<span class="text-lg">How do I calculate the days between two dates?</span>
						<span class="text-link group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform">▼</span>
					</summary>
					<p class="text-body leading-relaxed mt-4 pt-4 border-t border-hairline text-sm">
						To calculate the days between two dates, select your start date and end date in the input fields above and click "Calculate Days". The calculator instantly computes total elapsed calendar days, working business days, full weeks, and percentage of the year.
					</p>
				</details>
				
				<details class="group p-6 rounded-2xl bg-canvas border border-hairline card-shadow cursor-pointer">
